						<arrivalTick>6508000</arrivalTick>
						<text>A pack of man-hunting fennec foxes have entered the area! Driven insane by the disease known as scaria, they will roam the region, hunting for humanoid flesh.

They won't attack doors unless they see someone go through the door. Hide inside and you'll be safe. They also won't attack powered-off turrets, so turn your turrets off to save them.

The fennec foxes will leave the area in one or two days. You can hide and wait them out, or fight them.</text>
