				<li>
					<name>Beggar Hopes for Charity</name>
					<appearanceTick>434000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>434000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>442223</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>A poor traveler named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Frye&lt;/color&gt; is approaching looking for help. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Frye&lt;/color&gt; is begging for x30 silver. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Frye&lt;/color&gt; wants the silver to pay off a debt to a gang of pirates who are hunting him.

You can give items to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Frye&lt;/color&gt; by selecting a colonist and right-clicking on him.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Frye&lt;/color&gt; will move on after &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;1 day&lt;/color&gt;.

This traveler is not part of any faction. If you wish, you can choose to kill, arrest, sell, or harvest him, without diplomatic consequences.</description>
					<root>Beggars</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>1</id>
					<name>Helene and the Heat Wave</name>
					<appearanceTick>1005000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1064382</acceptanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>53936</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Success</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>1065021</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A 21-year-old cave explorer named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Helene Fisher&lt;/color&gt; is calling for help! She is hiding from a malfunctioning climate control satellite. She wants to flee and join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Colony&lt;/color&gt;.

If she joins you, an intense heat wave will last for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;5.4 days&lt;/color&gt; until the satellite resets.

Desperate to stay hidden, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Helene&lt;/color&gt; claims to be unable to tell you more about herself.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_GameCondition_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
				<li>
					<id>2</id>
					<name>Ship to the Stars</name>
					<appearanceTick>1200000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>1200000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>4</challengeRating>
					<description>A friendly AI from your past named (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) has sent you a message!

He reveals that he has a starship hidden on this planet, and sends you its world coordinates.

The starship is in deep hibernation mode. You'll have to start it up when you arrive, then defend it from raiders trying to steal it until the startup sequence completes. It will be a long, difficult series of battles.

If you can get the ship off the ground, (*Name)Charlon Whitestone(/Name) will take you off this rimworld, to the stars.</description>
