					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Antonina Diogenes&lt;/color&gt;, a baroness of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Blue Empire&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request of you.

(*Threat)Three groups of tribespeople(/Threat) from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Natrano Alliance&lt;/color&gt; have been harassing her caravans in the area. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Antonina&lt;/color&gt; asks that you send them a challenge message, attracting them to attack and eliminating the threat yourself.

The first group of tribespeople is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 penitent&lt;/color&gt;

Two similar-sized groups will follow soon after.

If you accept, the tribespeople will arrive in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;3 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
