					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Eudokia Pieixoto&lt;/color&gt;, a demolitionist, is calling from nearby. She has deserted the army of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Blue Empire&lt;/color&gt; and is being hunted by (*Threat)a loyalty squad(/Threat). She wishes to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Delunia&lt;/color&gt;.

