He will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2.2 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
