					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Brami Boomrat&lt;/color&gt;, Grand Chief of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Brío Coalition&lt;/color&gt;, wants you to help save one of his caravans. The caravan is being hunted near &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Delunia&lt;/color&gt; by (*Threat)two groups of tribespeople(/Threat) from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Natrano Alliance&lt;/color&gt;. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Boomrat&lt;/color&gt; wants you to signal the tribespeople to draw them away from the caravan - and towards you.

The first group of tribespeople is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 archers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 berserker&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 penitent&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 warriors&lt;/color&gt;

The second similar-sized group will follow soon after.

If you accept, the tribespeople will arrive in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
