					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>You've detected an orbiting spacedrone that may contain information about &lt;color=#947343FF&gt;Anlocus&lt;/color&gt;. You have the code that will force it to land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Delunia&lt;/color&gt;.

To get the information, hack into the drone's computer. Hacking takes time, but those strong in intellectual skill can speed up the process.

Tribespeople from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Natrano Alliance&lt;/color&gt; will spot the drone during its decent. As long as it's present, they'll send attackers approximately every &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 hours&lt;/color&gt; to destroy it and steal the wealth they think it contains. You will have some time to prepare defenses around it before they arrive.

After landing, the spacedrone will self-destruct in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;30 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
