				<li>
					<id>32</id>
					<name>The Peace Talks</name>
					<appearanceTick>5903000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>5903000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Fauna 'Furr' Wells&lt;/color&gt;, Christ's Ruler of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Ealor Nation&lt;/color&gt;, has sent us a message. She wants to talk with us in a nearby location.

It could be a great opportunity to improve relations with their faction and receive gifts, but beware - a poor negotiator can cause more harm than good and may even anger them.

Other factions will respect you more if you send your leader to handle the negotiations. High Stellarch &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Eudokia Pieixoto&lt;/color&gt; will get a bonus to the chance of a successful outcome.</description>
