				<li>
					<id>33</id>
					<name>Hidden Compound Examination</name>
					<appearanceTick>6024947</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>-60000</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gill&lt;/color&gt;, Prime Decider of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Fenoum Confederation&lt;/color&gt;, has discovered an ancient complex a long distance away. He believes it contains information about the relic known as &lt;color=#947343FF&gt;Anlocus&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gill&lt;/color&gt; can't spare people to look into it, but hopes you can help by supplying exactly 4 colonists to carry out the investigation.

The complex contains unknown threats and is also being sought by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gill&lt;/color&gt;'s enemies, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Ealor Nation&lt;/color&gt;.

He will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;3.2 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
