				<li>
					<id>34</id>
					<name>Paid Forced Weather</name>
					<appearanceTick>6438000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>173223</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A vengeful machine persona is threatening the outlanders of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Fenoum Confederation&lt;/color&gt;. Prime Decider &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gonzalo Gill&lt;/color&gt; wants you to send a message to the persona accepting responsibility for their transgressions.

If you do, the persona will turn its anger on you. A weather-control system will force the weather around &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Delunia&lt;/color&gt; to be a rainy thunderstorm for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;14 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_GameCondition_ItemPod</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts>
						<li Class="QuestPart_InvolvedFactions">
							<factions>
								<li>Faction_0</li>
							</factions>
						</li>
						<li Class="QuestPart_GameCondition">
							<inSignal>Quest34.OuterNodeCompleted</inSignal>
							<gameCondition Class="GameCondition_ForceWeather">
								<uniqueID>31</uniqueID>
								<def>WeatherController</def>
