						<name>Tribal Ranchism</name>
						<adjective>ranch</adjective>
						<memberName>Rancher</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. Nature's animals are the spirits of slaves, and demand to be taken into service. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rural Memento&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. Nature's animals are the spirits of slaves, and demand to be taken into service. It is prophesied that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>AbstractsC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkTeal</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.898, 0.675, 0.204, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Animist</li>
							<li>Rancher</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>ranching</name>
								<def>Ranching_Central</def>
								<ID>100</ID>
								<randomSeed>82884373</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
