						</foundation>
						<name>True Justice</name>
						<adjective>just</adjective>
						<memberName>Justicar</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Decider</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Decider</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Cody Jennings created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Jennings broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that he could. Jennings carried a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;sniper rifle&lt;/color&gt; named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ideo- Rifle&lt;/color&gt; with him everywhere to remind people to live an ethical life.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Cody Jennings created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Jennings broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that he could. Jennings carried a %%relic0_thingDef_label%% named %%relic0_name%% with him everywhere to remind people to live an ethical life.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>OliveBranches</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.418, 0.368, 0.803, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Just Eulogy</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>1</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1843015658</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies, other {MEMBERS} gather around their grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedPostfix>{0} {1} want to carry out the funeral as soon as possible.</ritualExpectedPostfix>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_1</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_MemberDied">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneral</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<lastFinishedTick>-1</lastFinishedTick>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Just Eulogy</name>
								<def>FuneralNoCorpse</def>
