						<name>Harmony Legion</name>
						<adjective>Prithviic</adjective>
						<memberName>Prithviite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Prithvi&lt;/color&gt; made all men and women from a great mold, and those that deviated she threw into fire so the believers could live in harmony. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Prithvi&lt;/color&gt; said to all the Prithviites, "Go forth and spread my word to all corners of the universe." The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Prithvi&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% made all men and women from a great mold, and those that deviated %%deity0_pronoun%% threw into fire so the believers could live in harmony. %%Deity0_name%% said to all the %%memberNamePlural%%, "Go forth and spread my word to all corners of the universe." The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
