						<name>Super-Kleptism</name>
						<adjective>kleptic</adjective>
						<memberName>Kleptor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken Cheese</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken Cheese</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Rose Hogan built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. One day while walking the streets, Rose was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Rose's followers never took pain-reducing drugs, knowing that their suffering would demonstrate their depth of belief.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Rose Hogan built an army that spread her power and glory across the land, placing those who refused to follow rightly under her rule. One day while walking the streets, Rose was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Rose's followers never took pain-reducing drugs, knowing that their suffering would demonstrate their depth of belief.</descriptionTemplate>
