						<name>Supreme Outlaw-Mimamsa</name>
						<adjective>Outlaw-Mimamsan</adjective>
						<memberName>Outlaw-Mimamsan</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Tirth Honcho</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Tirth Honcho</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>On the glitter-tech world Rogia, during the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Supreme Requiem&lt;/color&gt;, people would come to the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;High Shrine&lt;/color&gt; at the shrine of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Shiva&lt;/color&gt; and pray with assault in their hearts. A corrupt bureaucrat arose and threatened to destroy &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Shiva&lt;/color&gt; himself using remote-controlled mechanoid workers. A warrior named Nathan 'Alex' Otten used remote-controlled mechanoid workers to destroy a robotics factory. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Shiva&lt;/color&gt; saw Alex's ruthlessness and anointed him the rightful ruler of all humanity. Alex and the Outlaw-Mimamsans carried out a raiding campaign against the bionic guards' camps for many years, and eventually the corrupt bureaucrat was forced to surrender.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>On the glitter-tech world Rogia, during the %%ritual0_name%%, people would come to the %%altar0_name%% at the %%altarRoomLabel%% of %%deity0_name%% and pray with assault in their hearts. A corrupt bureaucrat arose and threatened to destroy %%deity0_name%% %%deity0_objective%%self using remote-controlled mechanoid workers. A warrior named Nathan 'Alex' Otten used remote-controlled mechanoid workers to destroy a robotics factory. %%Deity0_name%% saw Alex's ruthlessness and anointed him the rightful ruler of all humanity. Alex and the %%memberNamePlural%% carried out a raiding campaign against the bionic guards' camps for many years, and eventually the corrupt bureaucrat was forced to surrender.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>AbstractsE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOrange</colorDef>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginHindu</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>Raider</li>
						</memes>
