						<name>Rei'toxtroism</name>
						<adjective>Rei'toxtroic</adjective>
						<memberName>Rei'toxtroite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Dark Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Dark Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rei'toxtro&lt;/color&gt; went to his brother and murdered him, and feasted upon his flesh, and in absorbing its power became first among the gods. The people fought with the beasts of the forest, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rei'toxtro&lt;/color&gt; saw their rapacity, and struck down those who harmed the trees and beasts. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rei'toxtro&lt;/color&gt; created light so that humanity could know &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rei'toxtro&lt;/color&gt; through the shadows light creates.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% went to %%deity0_possessive%% brother and murdered him, and feasted upon his flesh, and in absorbing its power became first among the gods. The people fought with the beasts of the forest, and %%deity0_name%% saw their rapacity, and struck down those who harmed the trees and beasts. %%Deity0_name%% created light so that humanity could know %%deity0_name%% through the shadows light creates.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>KnivesDown</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkBlue</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.853, 0.745, 0.359, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistEmbodied</li>
							<li>Cannibal</li>
							<li>Darkness</li>
							<li>NaturePrimacy</li>
						</memes>
