						<name>Tribal Post-Buddhism</name>
						<adjective>Post-Buddhist</adjective>
						<memberName>Post-Buddhist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Wise Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Wise Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Hippopotamus Botoxrarve crashlanded on a distant world. Lacking food and surrounded by dead companions, she feasted, and became strong. To consecrate their commitment, Botoxrarve demanded that believers eat human flesh together at least every week. The male believers boasted and fought, so Botoxrarve cast them out of the council of leaders.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Hippopotamus Botoxrarve crashlanded on a distant world. Lacking food and surrounded by dead companions, she feasted, and became strong. To consecrate their commitment, Botoxrarve demanded that believers eat human flesh together at least every week. The male believers boasted and fought, so Botoxrarve cast them out of the council of leaders.</descriptionTemplate>
